WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.140
Ukrainian officials report explosions

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.142
in and around the Russian occupied

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.544
cities of Verdansk and Mariupol.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.247
They say at least five strikes targeted

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.950
Russian positions in Verdansk on Sunday.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.052
And one official says the explosions

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.087
in Mariupol caused casualties

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.089
but gave no further details.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.824
Meanwhile, the Ukrainian military

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.059
says Russia

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.427
launched one of its largest

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.195
drone attacks yet on Sunday.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.463
It coincides

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:31.631
with Tuesday,

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.099
the anniversary of the city's

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.969
founding more than 1500 years ago

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:36.903
keeps me.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:38.705
Also says more explosions

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.606
have been reported

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.274
across the Ukrainian capital

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:42.642
in recent hours.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.110
There are no reports of injuries.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.179
And the mayor wrote on Telegram

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.515
the air defense is at work.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.082
CNN's Fred

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.216
Pleitgen is in Kiev

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.019
with more on these attacks.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.954
Well, the Ukrainians are calling this

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.256
one of the largest attacks

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.524
using those Iranian

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:58.591
made to head drones

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:01.394
since Russia started its full on invasion

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:02.495
of Ukraine.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.630
The Ukrainian military

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.698
is saying that a 59 showerheads

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:07.767
that were launched towards its territory.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.602
They were able to take out 58.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.503
So that's obviously a pretty

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.504
big success

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.706
rate there for the Ukrainian military

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.476
and its ever improving air defense.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.611
Certainly the bulk of those drones

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:19.779
seem to be directed

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.081
at the Kiev region,

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.982
the Kiev and surrounding region.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.317
And there was some damage

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:24.884
that was caused.

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.286
There were two people who were killed.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.454
There were a lot of buildings

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:29.289
that were damaged as well.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:30.457
Most of that,

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.558
the authorities say,

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:33.560
came from falling debris.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.761
Also, there were some drone parts

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.097
apparently found near a warehouse

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.598
that had also sustained

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:39.499
some damage as well.

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.166
There was also

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.468
some pretty dramatic video

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.937
that came out from the Chernov region

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:44.637
that's in the north

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:45.271
of Ukraine

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.406
with border guards there

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:48.608
saying that they fired into the sky

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.009
when they saw and heard

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.744
those charred drones approaching.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.746
A man should take one of them down

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.715
using small arms fire.

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:58.017
President Zelensky of Ukraine,

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:58.685
he came out

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:00.353
and he praised the forces

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.922
that are fighting against those drones,

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.057
fighting against missiles as well.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.625
The Air Defense Force, as he called

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.627
them, heroes here in Ukraine

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:08.761
for keeping so many people

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.230
on the ground safe.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.297
At the same time,

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:13.133
the Ukrainians pretty angry

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.000
at the Iranians

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.669
for giving those drones to the Russians.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:17.070
In fact,

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.371
an adviser to Ukraine's

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:19.772
presidential administration,

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.373
he came out

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.875
and he warned the Iranians

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.510
that there could be retaliation.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.712
Fred Pleitgen, CNN, Kiev.

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.780
Ukraine's military says it's destroyed

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.749
almost 70 aerial targets

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.050
launched by Russia

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.119
in its latest onslaught overnight.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.087
That includes

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.222
more than three dozen cruise missiles

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.024
as well as Iranian made drones.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:39.692
And a reconnaissance drone.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:40.894
A police official in Kiev

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.195
says residential buildings

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.029
and infrastructure

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.797
in several districts were damaged,

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.100
but no one was killed or injured.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.568
This comes just a day

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:49.636
after Ukraine said

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:50.436
Russia had launched

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:52.038
one of the largest drone attacks

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.606
to date against Quique.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:54.207
CNN, Selma

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:56.209
Abdelaziz is here for more on this.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.144
So there's a huge focus on drone

00:02:58.144 --> 00:02:59.879
strikes on the capital.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:00.513
Obviously, Russia

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:01.814
trying to make gains in the east.

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.616
What is the strategy here

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.985
to focus so much firepower on Kiev?

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.320
So overnight this

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.455
massive barrage yet again,

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:10.590
something like.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.358
67 air targets,

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.326
according to Ukrainian

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:14.761
officials, taking out many of those,

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.896
as you mentioned, drones in missiles

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.365
The targets, Ukrainian officials

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.833
say, were military

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:21.601
infrastructure

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.102
and civilian infrastructure.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.204
And this comes just a day

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.672
after on Sunday.

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:27.273
Ukraine says it witnesses

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.442
it witnessed the largest assault

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.911
by drones since the conflict began.

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:33.580
Nearly 60 drones,

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.048
most of those were whelming

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:35.915
number of those

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:38.551
shattered Iranian made drones being fired

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:40.153
across Ukraine.

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:41.387
Most of those drones, all

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:42.722
but one of those drones,

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.723
according to Ukrainian

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.225
officials, was taken out.

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.392
So what do we take from this

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:47.227
Yes, as you mentioned,

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:49.395
it seems that there is an uptick here

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:50.930
in Russian assaults, far

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.999
from those front lines on other areas,

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.268
civilian areas across Ukraine.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.270
And yes, this terrifies

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.073
the citizens, the civilians of Ukraine.

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:02.542
But it also forces Ukraine

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:04.777
to use up valuable munitions.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:06.813
One of those shadow drones,

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:07.947
they're very cheaply made.

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:09.549
One of those shadow drones

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:11.517
cost about 20 times

00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:13.052
less than the missile

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:15.588
required to take out the drones.

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:16.856
You can see there

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.025
that Russia is forcing Ukraine

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:21.160
to use these valuable resources

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:21.661
at a time

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:23.029
that it really needs them

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:24.030
on the front line.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.698
But Ukrainian officials

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.000
The lesson here is

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.334
air defenses are working.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.236
The weapons that Neato has supplied,

00:04:30.236 --> 00:04:31.771
that is saving lives.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:33.139
And just briefly on the wider

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:34.307
geostrategic picture

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:34.540
here,

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.208
we've been hearing

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:36.542
some very alarming remarks

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:37.877
from the Belarussian leader,

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:40.246
Alexander Lukashenko, and his ever

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:41.314
closer union

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:43.816
with Russia when it comes to nuclear

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:44.951
and military assets.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.786
Yes, some chilling comments

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:47.587
from Lukashenko.

00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:48.388
Of course,

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:49.722
Belarus has essentially been used

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:50.857
as a satellite state

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:51.991
throughout this conflict

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.860
over the course of the last several days,

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:54.927
about week

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.729
Russia has began, begun,

00:04:56.729 --> 00:04:57.930
rather, transferring

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:00.300
tactical nuclear weapons to Belarus.

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:00.667
Of course,

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:01.834
Ukraine and its allies,

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:02.568
the United States,

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:03.703
naito see that

00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:06.272
as a violation of international law.

00:05:06.506 --> 00:05:07.173
But Lukashenko

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:09.208
making these comments to state media

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:10.343
just the other day

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:11.911
saying that nuclear weapons

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:14.247
would be available to anyone who joins

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:16.115
the Russia Belarus alliance.

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:17.650
I actually want to read you the comment

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.719
because it is so alarming.

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:20.820
It's very simple.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.488
Join the United States

00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:24.691
United Union, state of Belarus,

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:25.491
and Russia.

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:26.292
That's all.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:27.960
There will be nuclear weapons

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.128
for everyone.

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:31.164
And you can see how that begins

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:33.066
to worry international actors.

00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:33.833
And I suppose he's

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:34.967
talking about post-Soviet

00:05:34.967 --> 00:05:36.602
states like Kazakhstan.

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:37.704
Did you, Christiane, etc..

00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:39.372
Some Abdulaziz, thank you so much.

